From podcasting, comedy, and acting?

1099
00:33:38.000 --> 00:33:38.180
Yeah, everything.

1100
00:33:38.380 --> 00:33:39.620
You're just going to peace out.

1101
00:33:39.680 --> 00:33:40.180
