But I'm never going to do it, am I?

1110
00:33:50.440 --> 00:33:51.360
Why not?

1111
00:33:51.740 --> 00:33:53.480
Because I say it, but I don't think I will.

1112
00:33:53.560 --> 00:33:54.940
This is a beautiful idea.

1113
00:33:55.260 --> 00:33:59.820
Don't you feel compelled to be artistic and creative, though?

1114
00:34:00.380 --> 00:34:04.300
