They made a compilation of my bad table reads.

1254
00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:41.420
Do you do bad table reads?

1255
00:38:41.460 --> 00:38:41.720
I do.

1256
00:38:41.940 --> 00:38:42.980
You're not good at a table read?

1257
00:38:42.980 --> 00:38:43.400
I hate them.

1258
00:38:43.580 --> 00:38:45.020
Table reads are intimidating, though.

1259
00:38:45.200 --> 00:38:45.640
They are.

1260
00:38:45.780 --> 00:38:46.460
I think you kill it.

1261
00:38:46.620 --> 00:38:47.560
No, I don't.

1262
00:38:47.700 --> 00:38:48.280
She does.

1263
00:38:48.380 --> 00:38:48.660
She does.

1264
00:38:48.800 --> 00:38:50.520
She'll get, like, a guest spot on a show.

1265
00:38:50.620 --> 00:38:50.960
Yeah.

1266
00:38:51.100 --> 00:38:55.640
And she'll do the table read, and then they'll give her more lines the next day, because she

1267
00:38:55.640 --> 00:38:56.680
crushed the table read.

1268
00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:57.140
Wow.

1269
00:38:57.200 --> 00:38:58.220
That's Angela Kinsey.

1270
00:38:58.340 --> 00:38:58.700
Wow.

1271
00:38:58.880 --> 00:39:00.520
She's always, no, it's true, lady.

1272
00:39:00.520 --> 00:39:01.640
They're always, like, expanding.

1273
00:39:01.720 --> 00:39:04.060
You're like, oh, we wrote you another whole scene.

1274
00:39:04.060 --> 00:39:05.560
They take scenes away from me.

1275
00:39:05.640 --> 00:39:06.320
Because you crushed the table.

1276
00:39:06.640 --> 00:39:07.040
Yeah.

1277
00:39:07.260 --> 00:39:07.920
This is the truth.

1278
00:39:08.060 --> 00:39:10.280
I've literally had people go, we're not doing that scene.

1279
00:39:11.260 --> 00:39:12.900
And you go, oh, why?

1280
00:39:13.140 --> 00:39:13.940
But I know why.

1281
00:39:14.540 --> 00:39:15.960
Because I f***ed up the scene before.

1282
00:39:17.000 --> 00:39:18.500
It's hard when you're guest starring.

1283
00:39:19.000 --> 00:39:19.320
It is.

1284
00:39:19.460 --> 00:39:19.820
Guest starring is so hard.

1285
00:39:19.820 --> 00:39:22.920
Because people have been working together for maybe sometimes years.

1286
00:39:23.180 --> 00:39:23.420
Yeah.

1287
00:39:23.560 --> 00:39:23.740
Yeah.

1288
00:39:23.820 --> 00:39:25.260
And you're, like, a new person.

1289
00:39:26.480 --> 00:39:28.680
And sometimes they're not even that nice to you.

1290
00:39:29.020 --> 00:39:29.640
Here's the thing.

1291
00:39:29.680 --> 00:39:36.160
I'm okay at a table read, but I'm horrible at the chit-chat small talk once we're on set.

1292
00:39:36.160 --> 00:39:37.260
When you're a guest star?

1293
00:39:37.420 --> 00:39:37.700
Yeah.

1294
00:39:37.840 --> 00:39:41.640
Because I assume, like, if someone's like, oh, how are you?

1295
00:39:41.720 --> 00:39:42.420
How was your day?

1296
00:39:42.600 --> 00:39:43.280
Jenna knows.

1297
00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:45.840
I'll just say, well, here's the thing.

1298
00:39:47.200 --> 00:39:50.220
I think a rat is eating the inside of my car.

1299
00:39:51.320 --> 00:39:52.160
This is true.

1300
