But I will tell this person who's just, like, an AD who just is wanting to, like, walk right past me.

1301
00:39:58.760 --> 00:39:59.640
But it's a funny thing to say.

1302
00:40:00.120 --> 00:40:01.760
But it's just what's happening.

1303
00:40:01.980 --> 00:40:02.740
Do you know what I mean?

1304
00:40:02.940 --> 00:40:03.020
Yeah.

1305
00:40:03.080 --> 00:40:03.660
Sometimes, yeah.

1306
00:40:04.020 --> 00:40:04.660
And so then I—

1307
00:40:04.660 --> 00:40:05.420
Those are inside thoughts.

1308
00:40:05.520 --> 00:40:05.780
Yes.

1309
00:40:05.900 --> 00:40:10.680
And then I watch the person's eyes glaze over of, like, oh, my God.

1310
00:40:10.800 --> 00:40:12.660
I told Sarah Jessica Parker I had foot fungi.

1311
00:40:13.280 --> 00:40:13.860
Did you really?

1312
00:40:14.000 --> 00:40:17.400
You were sitting there, and she was doing crosswords or something, as they do.

1313
00:40:17.580 --> 00:40:18.120
Oh, yes.

1314
00:40:18.120 --> 00:40:19.800
You were so good on that show.

1315
00:40:20.000 --> 00:40:20.720
No, I wasn't.

1316
00:40:20.760 --> 00:40:21.580
And just like that.

1317
00:40:22.020 --> 00:40:23.540
I don't think I was, but thank you.

1318
00:40:23.700 --> 00:40:24.260
Stop it!

1319
00:40:24.520 --> 00:40:26.480
But, yeah, I remember, like, doing that.

1320
00:40:26.640 --> 00:40:27.380
Making conversation.

1321
00:40:27.560 --> 00:40:33.740
Yeah, but it was, like, my—like, I'm around a lot of comedians, you know, and she was super nice.

1322
00:40:34.020 --> 00:40:34.840
I love her.

1323
00:40:35.040 --> 00:40:35.380
Of course.

1324
00:40:35.380 --> 00:40:35.500
You know what I mean?

1325
00:40:35.580 --> 00:40:37.440
But I didn't know what to bring up.

1326
00:40:37.780 --> 00:40:40.540
Can I tell you my super cringe story?

1327
00:40:40.880 --> 00:40:41.120
Tell me.

1328
00:40:41.220 --> 00:40:42.220
Of being a co-star.

1329
00:40:42.220 --> 00:40:43.860
Not even a guest star.

1330
00:40:44.120 --> 00:40:44.820
Not a recurring.

1331
00:40:44.820 --> 00:40:45.400
What's the difference?

1332
00:40:45.620 --> 00:40:48.040
Okay, you were recurring on, and just like that.

1333
00:40:48.220 --> 00:40:50.440
You were in several episodes, but not every episode.

1334
00:40:51.280 --> 00:40:51.460
Yeah.

1335
00:40:51.700 --> 00:40:52.900
You're in many episodes, though.

1336
00:40:53.120 --> 00:40:53.600
That's recurring.

1337
00:40:53.980 --> 00:40:54.780
That's great.

1338
00:40:55.000 --> 00:40:56.280
You're, like, kind of part of the caSt.

1339
00:40:56.280 --> 00:40:57.040
What's guest starring?

1340
00:40:57.200 --> 00:40:59.320
Guest star is when you have, like—

1341
00:40:59.320 --> 00:40:59.800
One episode.

1342
00:40:59.880 --> 00:41:00.420
One week.

1343
